SDUSD::maxWithdraw
├── when PAUSE_TYPE is paused
│   └── it should return zero
├── when owner has no shares
│   └── it should return zero
├── when owner has shares and no reward period is active
│   ├── it should return the rounded-down asset value of the owner's shares
│   └── it should exclude assets backing the permanent seed shares
├── when a reward period is active
│   ├── it should include only currently unlocked rewards
│   └── it should exclude all still-locked rewards
├── when FROZEN_TYPE is active
│   └── it should continue returning the owner's available assets
└── when the vault has received a raw DUSD donation
    └── it should not include the donation
